    {
        "text": "Doctor, I took a quick stroll around. Didn't seem like there were any others.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "Looks like we're gonna have to head back into the rainforest to look for her bunch after this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_070"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014\u2014! (Cry of victory)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Peta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$livecrowd",
        "volume": 0.2,
        "loop": false,
        "channel": "people"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, Peta won.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "This Peta's pretty good. Makes me wanna rumble with him, actually.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Mm-hm! He's one of my tribe's warriors.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "text": "But he's definitely not as good as you, Gavial.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Haha, easy enough to say.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Come on, Gavial! You already came so close to becoming Great Chief over when we were little! Like you could lose to Peta!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "When you were little?",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmm? Oh, yeah, that one time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "I was super young. Thought the idea was so cool, I actually went in for the ceremony once.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah, and you were already so super strong by then!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "initr": 2,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
