    },
    {
        "text": "Im... Impossible... Just two punches...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria Champion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_411_tomimi_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Gavial's... so strong...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph! I guess that's all, then!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who else wants some?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
