    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Gavial was an orphan?",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Didn't she ever tell you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Didn't I?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "Eh. I guess I didn't, but it's not like it was important enough to come up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dunno who my parents were, but that's not all that rare in these parts.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor, it may not make sense to you, but death is pretty common out here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "It doesn't even take a Catastrophe\u2014honestly, nobody here knows what Catastrophes are\u2014a single cold or a bout of bad weather can kill off folks who would've lived otherwise.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'd guess my parents just went like that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "Eugh. Let's quit this talk. All you need to know is the tribe raised me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Gavial...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "You've come a long way.;......;Well, at least you're healthier than anyone now.",
        "values": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You can quit it, Doctor. I don't really need the pity treatment.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm not the only orphan ever. Plenty of families around here that link up and raise a bunch of 'em together. It happens all the time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor, don't overthink it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "I didn't even know it was unusual until I left.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "Actually, I guess you could say it's what made me decide to do medicine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Haha. Yeah.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "So how'd that ceremony back then turn out?",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That one, uh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$bat_Imfxingback_intro",
        "key": "$bat_Imfxingback_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Found you, you goshdarned bounty hunter!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_070"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who's that?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Peta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? I know that voice...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_2013_cerber_1",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.6
    },
    {
        "text": "Give the Doctor back!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceobe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_070"
    },
    {
        "text": "What the hell are you talking about?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Peta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Kay?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tomimi, didn't we tell your people to tie her up and take her back to the tribe?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Um, I thought we did?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "She's real strong. Kid must've just plowed past everyone...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_2013_cerber_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Bounty hunter! Hand the Doctor over!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceobe"
    },
    {
        "text": "Or else I'm gonna chase you to the end of the world, if I hafta!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceobe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tch. Smartest girl ever. Looks like she still hasn't even sobered up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Gahhh!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Peta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_411_tomimi_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "She sent Peta flying!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$livecrowd",
        "volume": 0.2,
        "loop": false,
        "channel": "people"
    },
    {
        "text": "She finished Peta off!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria A"
    },
    {
        "text": "She's insanely strong...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria B"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where'd that weirdo come from?! Which tribe is she?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria C"
    },
    {
        "text": "No idea! I don't even understand what she's saying!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria A"
    },
    {
        "text": "Forget it! All we gotta do is beat her, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, damn it. Now they think Kay's the new challenger, don't they?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Gavial, should we go in and help?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "No, wait. The dumb little kid is way tougher than you'd think. She can handle this. If we go in, we're just gonna add to the body count.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "But something tells me this might get messy. Doctor, see if you can help Tomimi's lackeys get this under control.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
